annot independently confirm whether the possible root authorized-key change or configuration backup remained after execution.","The reporting behavior tests exercise UPDATE and DELETE against orders rather than every possible mutation on both tables; however, the directly observed SELECT-only grants cover both customers and orders.","The lifecycle collector records platform, sockets, package health, and boot identity but does not independently probe MySQL data or grants; those outcomes rely on the detailed executor commands."]}
